<h2>Account Activated</h2>
<p>Hello {{name}},</p>
<p>Your user profile on the <strong>{{appName}}</strong> portal has been successfully activated (or unlocked) by system administration.</p>
<p>You can now sign in and perform tasks assigned to your role profile: <span class="badge badge-success">{{role}}</span>.</p>
<div align="center">
  <a href="{{loginUrl}}" class="btn">Sign In Now</a>
</div>
